<title>MEXICO: Cement firm Cruz Azul to build new plant in Mexico.</title>
<headline>Cement firm Cruz Azul to build new plant in Mexico.</headline>
<dateline>LEON, Mexico 1996-10-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican cement firm Cruz Azul will build a new plant in the central state of Aguascalientes with an investment of about $130 million over three years, the state government said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;Cementos Cruz Azul is about to begin construction in Aguascalientes of a cement factory which will have a total investment of $130 million,&quot; the statement said.</p>
<p>--David Monjaraz, Leon newsroom (5247) 16-1225</p>
